// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2602496888" "You tune into the radio and search for the tell-tale sound of Radio Free Opportunity's announcer: <br><br>'We're the sound you need every day of your evil lives, it's Radio <br><br>RADIO! <br><br>RADIOOOOOO Free Opportunity. Seems that the Council's Spymaster ran into a big problem that goes by the name of {VillainName}. Now their spy's all busted up, but there's nothing they can do about it. Too bad for those fellas, just goes to show that you should know to listen to the Radio! That is, as long as it's  Radio! <br><br>RADIO! <br><br>RADIOOOOOO! Free Opportunity!'"
// RandomFameString :
"P4139126172" "I heard {VillainName} took on an entire Arachnos base just to take out one particular agent. I wonder why Arachnos hasn't struck back?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1012097776" "You tune into the radio and search for the tell-tale sound of Radio Free Opportunity's announcer: <br><br>'We're the sound you need every day of your evil lives, it's Radio <br><br>RADIO! <br><br>RADIOOOOO! Free Opportunity! Seems that the Council's Spymaster ran into a big problem that goes by the name of {VillainName}. But it looks like their Spy got away before the leading contender for Villain of the Year could catch up to him. Those Council guys sure are tricky.'"
